WEBVTT

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:09.020
<i>But you could try</i>

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:11.530
<i>smiling at him when things are safe, right?</i>

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:14.170
<i>Show him you're an older sister 
who can handle herself.</i>

00:00:14.170 --> 00:00:17.620
A smile... like you're about to give him a big hug.

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:31.760
I don't know if I've ever smiled right in my life.

00:00:38.590 --> 00:00:39.840
Then, we'll be leaving.

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:41.520
Thank you.

00:00:42.260 --> 00:00:44.770
I'm happy to have a new drinking buddy.

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:46.020
Come again.

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:47.100
I will!

00:00:48.170 --> 00:00:50.630
<i>She kept up with Mother's drinking?</i>

00:00:51.720 --> 00:00:52.790
Utao...

00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:56.610
Be well.

00:00:57.270 --> 00:00:59.620
Take care of yourself.

00:01:40.630 --> 00:01:41.990
Wait!

00:01:44.140 --> 00:01:46.210
<i>Smile, smile...</i>

00:01:46.210 --> 00:01:48.060
<i>Like a big sister!</i>

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:50.630
<i>Like you're about to give him a big hug.</i>

00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:54.630
<i>Like you practiced last night!</i>

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:13.230
<i>Guess that didn't work...</i>

00:02:17.390 --> 00:02:19.450
<i>Damn Koushiro.</i>

00:02:24.670 --> 00:02:30.530
Utao-sama!

00:04:03.070 --> 00:04:07.300
With Kukuri repaired, we went back to Tokyo.

00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:09.480
Back in the bustle of the big city,

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:11.880
our few days in Karakami Village

00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:14.280
seemed like they'd happened years ago.

00:04:15.780 --> 00:04:17.270
That's a pretty beach house...

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:18.630
The ocean!

00:04:18.630 --> 00:04:21.560
My friend quit his job and opened a boardinghouse.

00:04:21.560 --> 00:04:23.740
He invited me to come.

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:24.660
The beach!

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:28.940
That's right. You've never really seen the beach.

00:04:29.550 --> 00:04:31.000
The beach...

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:44.050
<b>Episode 8</b>

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:44.050
<b>The Role of a God</b>

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:49.930
Typhoon 17 will maintain strength, as it reaches

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:53.560
the Bousou Peninsula this evening.

00:04:55.050 --> 00:04:56.440
The beach...

00:04:56.570 --> 00:04:58.930
August is over, so I guess it's to be expected.

00:04:58.930 --> 00:05:01.880
And we just got new swimsuits, too.

00:05:02.630 --> 00:05:04.990
Too bad, you guys.

00:05:05.430 --> 00:05:07.480
O-Oh, hello there.

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:09.980
Enjoy yourselves, I guess.

00:05:09.980 --> 00:05:11.970
You're my only guests.

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:14.560
To be honest, I was amazed you wanted to come at all.

00:05:14.560 --> 00:05:18.230
One of us was really, really looking forward to it.

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:20.500
So we hoped it would blow over 
before we arrived.

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:22.610
Though, obviously, it didn't.

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:24.510
The beach...

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:28.690
It's so fluffy!

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:34.310
I so tense from driving through the pouring rain.

00:05:34.490 --> 00:05:37.310
We should make Kyohei get his license.

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:38.770
You're right...

00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:41.840
It's wet.

00:05:45.810 --> 00:05:46.860
A leak?

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:50.020
It seems pretty bad.

00:05:50.020 --> 00:05:51.120
I'll have a look!

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:55.630
Wait, use Kukuri to look first...

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:03.580
This is really bad...

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:07.270
I'll talk to Murata-san and get us another room.

00:06:07.270 --> 00:06:09.340
You go take a bath.

00:06:11.980 --> 00:06:13.300
Hibino-san?

00:06:13.300 --> 00:06:15.270
Is your room leaking, too?

00:06:15.230 --> 00:06:15.910
Yeah...

00:06:18.600 --> 00:06:19.440
Murata-san?

00:06:19.910 --> 00:06:21.550
What are you doing?

00:06:21.550 --> 00:06:23.190
Oh, hey there.

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:25.440
This typhoon is really bad.

00:06:26.020 --> 00:06:27.670
Did you need something?

00:06:27.670 --> 00:06:31.160
Um, actually, our rooms are leaking.

00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:34.890
Are you okay?

00:06:35.650 --> 00:06:36.780
I'm sorry!

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:41.040
Wh-What?

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:45.800
Murata-san?

00:06:48.870 --> 00:06:51.240
It'd be dangerous to try and move it myself.

00:06:51.240 --> 00:06:52.740
But if we don't...

00:06:52.740 --> 00:06:54.390
I know! Get Kukuri!

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:56.520
Utao-chan's in the bath.

00:06:56.520 --> 00:06:57.410
I'll go get her.

00:06:57.410 --> 00:06:59.020
Thanks!

00:07:01.050 --> 00:07:02.660
Th-The power's out?

00:07:02.660 --> 00:07:04.020
At a time like this...

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:08.490
Utao-chan?

00:07:08.870 --> 00:07:11.100
H-Hibino!

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:12.240
Utao-chan?

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:13.820
Where are you?

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:15.730
Utao-chan!

00:07:15.730 --> 00:07:17.450
I can't see you!

00:07:19.950 --> 00:07:21.330
H-Hibino?

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:24.800
It's fine.

00:07:24.800 --> 00:07:25.540
Pull him.

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:26.620
Here I go.

00:07:28.520 --> 00:07:29.460
Good!

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:34.580
Are you all right?

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:35.430
Yeah...

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:38.550
That was amazing. I couldn't even move.

00:07:38.550 --> 00:07:40.820
You're really strong, Hibino-kun.

00:07:47.060 --> 00:07:48.900
Utao-chan, give me a hand.

00:07:49.510 --> 00:07:50.740
Why are you in your swimsuit?

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:53.760
There's other stuff we need to do.

00:07:53.760 --> 00:07:57.290
And there are guys here, 
so I want to be prepared if I get wet.

00:07:57.290 --> 00:07:59.670
I see! Then I'll wear mine, too.

00:07:59.670 --> 00:08:01.270
I did just buy it.

00:08:01.270 --> 00:08:04.170
Though, this isn't what I had in mind for it.

00:08:06.270 --> 00:08:07.630
No good...

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:10.120
This can be fixed at the breaker.

00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:12.600
He said there's a generator in the shed out back.

00:08:12.600 --> 00:08:13.680
I see.

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:14.970
Utao!

00:08:23.880 --> 00:08:24.770
Well?

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:26.610
It's too dark to see.

00:08:29.770 --> 00:08:30.990
The wind's really bad.

00:08:32.750 --> 00:08:34.790
I hope nothing falls on me...

00:08:36.810 --> 00:08:39.670
Hey, Kukuri. Good job back there.

00:08:43.170 --> 00:08:44.370
That's it, huh?

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:45.690
Okay.

00:08:45.690 --> 00:08:47.190
Then, hold this for me.

00:08:49.010 --> 00:08:51.840
It suddenly got dark! I can't see anything.

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:54.470
Stay back!

00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:56.760
Wh-What? What happened?

00:08:56.760 --> 00:08:57.800
Wh-What's going on?

00:08:57.800 --> 00:09:00.630
I think I did something I shouldn't have...

00:09:00.630 --> 00:09:02.480
Something you shouldn't have?

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:04.440
Something went squish.

00:09:07.040 --> 00:09:09.360
I guess I have no choice.

00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:11.960
Kuga-kun!

00:09:11.960 --> 00:09:13.850
Kuga-kun, are you okay?

00:09:17.350 --> 00:09:18.700
Hibino-san?

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:21.510
Good, you don't seem hurt.

00:09:21.510 --> 00:09:22.960
Ow...

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:24.370
What happened?

00:09:24.810 --> 00:09:26.580
Kukuri got covered with a sheet.

00:09:31.470 --> 00:09:32.380
I can see!

00:09:34.930 --> 00:09:35.670
Hurry!

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:37.430
While the wind's died down!

00:09:41.630 --> 00:09:44.090
All right! Nice job not falling over!

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:46.830
Are you okay, Hibino-san?

00:09:46.830 --> 00:09:48.190
Yeah, I guess so...

00:09:50.410 --> 00:09:51.220
Hibino?

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:57.140
Hibino-san? Hibino-san!

00:09:57.140 --> 00:09:58.230
I'm up here!

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:01.580
Are you okay?

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:03.080
I-I think so.

00:10:05.310 --> 00:10:07.210
Utao, great job!

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:16.050
The calm after the storm, huh?

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:18.380
It's all clear.

00:10:20.260 --> 00:10:22.760
It's going to be hard to fix this.

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:24.060
Yeah.

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:26.040
It looks like the ambulances are busy,

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:28.190
so it'll be a while before they get here.

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:32.420
That was a big typhoon, 
so I'm sure they've got plenty to do.

00:10:32.420 --> 00:10:33.600
Yeah.

00:10:34.450 --> 00:10:35.320
Oh, Utao.

00:10:35.880 --> 00:10:38.020
The beach is down that way.

00:10:38.020 --> 00:10:39.880
You and Hibino-san go ahead.

00:10:39.880 --> 00:10:40.790
But...

00:10:40.790 --> 00:10:43.950
Don't worry about it. Murata-san just hurt his legs.

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:46.390
There's nothing you can do for him.

00:10:46.390 --> 00:10:49.560
Yeah, let's go down there.

00:10:51.990 --> 00:10:55.090
The waves are still high, so no swimming.

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:57.060
Kyohei!

00:10:58.170 --> 00:11:00.940
I'm sorry for what happened last night.

00:11:00.940 --> 00:11:03.910
What are you talking about? You did great.

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:05.750
That's right.

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:07.270
You saved me, too.

00:11:07.690 --> 00:11:10.270
Kukuri's a good god, right?

00:11:10.790 --> 00:11:11.750
Really?

00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:12.640
Yup.

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:13.940
Let's go.

00:11:19.110 --> 00:11:21.290
Hibino, hurry!

00:11:37.310 --> 00:11:38.590
Karakami Village?

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:40.840
It's really in the middle of nowhere.

00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:44.250
It's a miracle they ran a highway to the place.

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:46.600
There's nothing on their homepage, either.

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:48.770
You're not going there to investigate, are you?

00:11:48.770 --> 00:11:51.880
Unfortunately, I never got permission.

00:11:51.880 --> 00:11:54.420
You really were going to go?

00:11:54.420 --> 00:11:56.400
It's not that big a case...

00:11:57.130 --> 00:12:00.100
I was sure that thing with the dolls a while back

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:02.790
would be more up your alley.

00:12:02.790 --> 00:12:07.200
<i>I'm sure they're involved 
with the doll thing somehow.</i>

00:12:08.190 --> 00:12:11.720
Dad, are these all the books 
you got from the library?

00:12:11.720 --> 00:12:12.550
Yeah.

00:12:12.990 --> 00:12:16.040
Okay, Utao-chan, you'll be
on your own, for a while.

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:16.990
Roger!

00:12:19.970 --> 00:12:21.950
Is the city library big?

00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:25.780
Oh, yeah... You've only seen the

00:12:25.780 --> 00:12:27.640
village library room, right?

00:12:27.870 --> 00:12:29.850
You mean it's a lot bigger than that?

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:30.930
A whole lot.

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:35.060
I'm back.

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:36.400
Welcome back.

00:12:36.960 --> 00:12:38.560
Where's Hibino-san?

00:12:38.560 --> 00:12:39.760
Did she go out?

00:12:39.760 --> 00:12:41.340
Yeah, to the library.

00:12:41.340 --> 00:12:43.110
She went to return the books I borrowed.

00:12:43.110 --> 00:12:46.370
Kyohei, I heard the city library is really big!

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:48.400
Oh, right. You've never seen one before.

00:12:48.510 --> 00:12:52.040
Oh, no. I forgot one.

00:12:49.280 --> 00:12:52.040
<b>The Origin of Creative Snacks</b>

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:54.330
What should I do?

00:12:59.160 --> 00:13:01.640
I'll take over for you, for a bit.

00:13:01.640 --> 00:13:02.510
Would that be all right?

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:06.050
Will you be okay on your own, Utao-chan?

00:13:06.050 --> 00:13:07.010
I will!

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:09.510
Then I'll see you later.

00:13:10.040 --> 00:13:11.560
See you later!

00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:15.140
You know...

00:13:15.970 --> 00:13:20.400
The minute the two girls left, 
all the customers fled.

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:25.240
I would hate it if that were
my only type of customer.

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:26.910
If that happened,

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:30.160
you could turn the whole thing into a cosplay café.

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:33.260
I'm getting mad.

00:13:33.260 --> 00:13:34.160
Sorry.

00:13:34.840 --> 00:13:38.560
That said, how was it? Going back.

00:13:39.180 --> 00:13:42.170
Nothing's changed.

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:46.260
Hibino-san seemed to like it.

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:50.610
If you're visiting, it's a nice place.

00:13:50.610 --> 00:13:52.140
That's true.

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:56.650
I was wrong.

00:13:56.650 --> 00:13:59.420
It's been twenty years since I left the village.

00:13:59.420 --> 00:14:02.190
I was sure I'd severed all my ties.

00:14:03.430 --> 00:14:06.270
But I was wrong.

00:14:06.270 --> 00:14:09.700
That village will never release 
anyone who was born there.

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:10.840
Ever.

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:16.080
Then that also applies to me?

00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:21.060
<i>There are some things</i>

00:14:21.060 --> 00:14:23.140
<i>you only realize by talking about them.</i>

00:14:24.220 --> 00:14:27.590
<i>Six years ago, the real reason I quit being a Seki</i>

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:31.070
<i>was that I was scared...</i>

00:14:31.070 --> 00:14:33.610
<i>Of what would happen when I snapped.</i>

00:14:33.610 --> 00:14:37.590
<i>Of what's inside Aki being inside me, too.</i>

00:14:37.590 --> 00:14:39.040
<i>I understand now.</i>

00:14:40.470 --> 00:14:41.540
<i>Aki,</i>

00:14:42.340 --> 00:14:45.110
<i>where are you?</i>

00:14:45.110 --> 00:14:47.110
<b>Tokyo International General Library</b>

00:14:47.460 --> 00:14:49.300
You're missing one book.

00:14:53.060 --> 00:14:55.370
Oh, Dad...

00:14:57.210 --> 00:14:59.540
It's the latest <i>Musica Nova</i>.

00:15:01.680 --> 00:15:03.420
I'll read it for a bit.

00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:13.430
Aki-san?

00:15:15.030 --> 00:15:16.150
Yo.

00:15:16.150 --> 00:15:17.310
Strange seeing you here.

00:15:18.010 --> 00:15:19.120
What's wrong?

00:15:19.120 --> 00:15:20.310
Have a seat.

00:15:21.720 --> 00:15:23.300
O-Okay.

00:15:25.180 --> 00:15:26.940
Kyohei told you something.

00:15:28.870 --> 00:15:30.570
I can see it on your face.

00:15:32.270 --> 00:15:36.390
Yeah, he did... About your sensei.

00:15:36.390 --> 00:15:37.200
And?

00:15:37.980 --> 00:15:41.610
I think I understand what happened with you,

00:15:41.610 --> 00:15:44.520
Kuga-kun, and Karakami Village. But...

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:46.590
Go on.

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:50.170
But now, there's one thing I don't understand...

00:15:50.540 --> 00:15:52.590
Your obsession with Kuga-kun.

00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:56.360
If you hate the rest of them, 
deal with them yourself.

00:15:56.360 --> 00:15:58.610
You have the power to.

00:15:58.610 --> 00:16:00.350
Why involve Kuga-kun?

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:04.980
Do you like Kyohei?

00:16:07.050 --> 00:16:08.460
I don't know.

00:16:08.460 --> 00:16:11.990
But either way, it has nothing to do with you.

00:16:12.370 --> 00:16:14.010
That's not true.

00:16:14.010 --> 00:16:19.500
If you're together, it matters to me. 
Regardless of what he wants.

00:16:21.170 --> 00:16:23.230
Like with you and Senou-sensei?

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:29.760
So you're going to bring her up?

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:33.720
I'm sorry.

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:36.890
It's fine.

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:39.280
Let's get back to the point.

00:16:39.280 --> 00:16:40.910
We were talking about Kyohei.

00:16:40.910 --> 00:16:44.140
Neither you nor the idiots 
at the shrine have noticed,

00:16:44.530 --> 00:16:48.460
but there's something terrible and dark inside him.

00:16:49.030 --> 00:16:51.530
Kuga-kun has that power?

00:16:51.890 --> 00:16:53.740
He's a rich little snot,

00:16:53.740 --> 00:16:56.770
so he may not have noticed.

00:16:56.770 --> 00:17:01.040
Or maybe he's avoiding me because he has.

00:17:04.620 --> 00:17:06.210
It just occurred to me...

00:17:07.070 --> 00:17:11.800
If I did something to you, maybe that'd piss him off.

00:17:17.690 --> 00:17:18.970
Aki!

00:17:21.740 --> 00:17:23.850
Wait! You can't fight here!

00:17:52.380 --> 00:17:54.010
You've improved, haven't you?

00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:58.620
Aki!

00:17:58.620 --> 00:18:00.180
Go back to the village!

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:04.430
The kakashi don't exist for you to 
break things and kill people!

00:18:06.090 --> 00:18:08.190
Then what are they for?

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:09.990
Well...

00:18:14.490 --> 00:18:17.110
For saving people! For good things!

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:30.190
Well?

00:18:30.190 --> 00:18:32.380
Good things? Saving people?

00:18:36.120 --> 00:18:37.640
Don't make me laugh.

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:40.860
Kukuri!

00:18:40.860 --> 00:18:46.590
Sorry, but all our gods can do 
is murder and destroy.

00:18:47.740 --> 00:18:49.400
Do you know why?

00:18:49.830 --> 00:18:52.520
Because they've got human hearts inside.

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:56.620
Are those the things on TV?

00:18:56.620 --> 00:18:57.780
Over there! Over there!

00:18:57.780 --> 00:18:59.070
What are they?

00:19:00.840 --> 00:19:02.870
Tell Kyohei...

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:06.330
Our game isn't over.

00:19:14.330 --> 00:19:16.160
Welcome back...

00:19:16.160 --> 00:19:17.260
H-Hibino-san?

00:19:17.790 --> 00:19:18.960
Hibino?

00:19:18.960 --> 00:19:19.910
What's wrong?

00:19:19.910 --> 00:19:21.050
What happened?

00:19:22.070 --> 00:19:23.300
We saw Aki.

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:25.470
Hibino-san?!

00:19:25.920 --> 00:19:27.980
Did he say something bad to you?

00:19:27.980 --> 00:19:31.270
Did he do anything?

00:19:32.210 --> 00:19:34.820
I was there, so I wouldn't let him.

00:19:34.820 --> 00:19:35.960
I see.

00:19:37.240 --> 00:19:38.190
Hibino-san!

00:19:38.660 --> 00:19:39.850
Hibino-san!

00:19:39.850 --> 00:19:42.450
<i>For some reason, this is really upsetting.</i>

00:19:43.390 --> 00:19:48.690
<i>Everyone involved in this is crazy...</i>

00:19:48.690 --> 00:19:52.420
<i>They keep trying to confuse people 
with what they say,</i>

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:56.080
<i>and then telling them, "You don't understand!"</i>

00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:58.380
Hibino-san! Hibino-san!

00:19:58.830 --> 00:19:59.490
Hibino-san?

00:20:02.480 --> 00:20:03.100
Hibino-san!

00:20:03.100 --> 00:20:06.260
Would you leave me alone...

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:17.900
I'm sorry!

00:20:22.440 --> 00:20:24.490
I didn't mean to...

00:20:25.620 --> 00:20:28.320
Freak! Jerk! Molester! Scum!

00:20:27.840 --> 00:20:28.260
Utao!

00:20:28.320 --> 00:20:29.620
Stop it!

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:31.710
Pervert! Idiot!

00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:34.180
Cheater!

00:20:41.240 --> 00:20:46.890
Aki said that kakashi can only kill and destroy...

00:20:47.930 --> 00:20:50.040
He said that that's all they can do,

00:20:50.040 --> 00:20:52.420
because they have human hearts.

00:20:53.320 --> 00:20:55.840
<i>Aki, you...</i>

00:20:55.840 --> 00:20:57.150
Is that true?

00:20:58.070 --> 00:21:02.230
No matter what good things I try to use it for,

00:21:02.230 --> 00:21:05.730
will it just kill and destroy?

00:21:06.310 --> 00:21:08.160
That isn't true.

00:21:08.890 --> 00:21:10.800
If what he said is right,

00:21:10.800 --> 00:21:13.210
if it has a human heart inside,

00:21:13.210 --> 00:21:14.670
then you decide what it does.

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:20.300
If you don't want to do those things, 
then Kukuri will be a good god.

00:21:30.860 --> 00:21:32.060
<i>Kuramitsuha...</i>

00:21:33.210 --> 00:21:35.850
<i>Is that what you wanted to be?</i>

00:21:39.470 --> 00:21:42.280
<i>It's too late to change.</i>

00:21:54.670 --> 00:21:56.790
That took forever...

00:21:55.050 --> 00:21:56.790
Jeez.

00:21:57.520 --> 00:21:59.880
What's wrong, Kirio?

00:22:01.140 --> 00:22:04.970
The air here's still as dirty as ever.

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:46.900
<b>Kamisama 
Dolls</b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:46.900
<b>Corner</b>

00:23:35.400 --> 00:23:38.360
Once again, it's time for Kamisama Dolls Corner!

00:23:38.360 --> 00:23:39.990
This time, it's a special on me.

00:23:38.750 --> 00:23:41.060
<b>This 
Is Me!!</b>

00:23:39.990 --> 00:23:41.490
Kukuri is extraordinarily happy!

00:23:41.490 --> 00:23:42.450
How embarrassing!

00:23:42.450 --> 00:23:44.010
I make all kinds of faces, don't I?

00:23:44.010 --> 00:23:45.730
Don't show that face...

00:23:45.730 --> 00:23:46.900
Stop! Stop!

00:23:46.900 --> 00:23:48.310
Next time: Tangled Relations.

00:23:46.920 --> 00:23:49.950
<b>Next Episode: 
Tangled Relations</b>

00:23:48.310 --> 00:23:49.950
I'll curse you if you don't watch, okay?

00:23:49.950 --> 00:23:54.570
